  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-snapshot",
      "text": "Backup / restore / rotate snapshots of `~/.dsh` for DeepSeek Harness.\n\n- Archives go to `~/dsh-backups/dsh-backup-<ts>.tar.gz` (outside `~/.dsh`).\n- `node_modules` / `cache` are excluded (regenerable); configs, sessions,\n  credentials and plugin manifests are kept.\n- Every archive ships a `.sha256` sidecar; `snapshot_list` verifies them.\n- Restore validates every archive entry stays inside the destination root\n  (path-traversal guard) and refuses to run without `confirm: true`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Tools",
      "text": "- `snapshot_backup` — create a snapshot (keep: number of archives to retain)\n- `snapshot_list` — list snapshots with sha256 verification\n- `snapshot_restore` — restore a snapshot (requires confirm: true)"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
